            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"suggested-paper-listing-copy-the-next-cell\">Suggested paper listing \u2014 copy the next cell</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The next cell is self-contained Python. Copy its body into the paper;\nno other notebook cell or Marimo helper is needed. Unknown currents acquire\nsymbolic components automatically. The exact HEP library supplies the Weyl\nmatrices; <code>components()</code> exposes the same generated input symbols afterward.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Suggested caption:</strong> Deriving the four symbolic components of\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(K^\\mu=\\bar J\\gamma^\\mu J||)</marimo-tex> with Spenso. Repeated spinor indices are\ncontracted, while the Lorentz index remains open.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
