          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"check-every-component-exactly\">Check every component exactly</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The built-in HEP library uses Weyl matrices with metric\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(g=\\mathrm{diag}(1,-1,-1,-1)||)</marimo-tex>:\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\gamma^0=\\left(\\begin{smallmatrix}0&amp;I\\\\I&amp;0\\end{smallmatrix}\\right)||)</marimo-tex> and\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\gamma^i=\\left(\\begin{smallmatrix}0&amp;\\sigma^i\\\\-\\sigma^i&amp;0\\end{smallmatrix}\\right)||)</marimo-tex>.\nAn independent matrix calculation checks all four symbolic polynomials,\nincluding their signs and the imaginary entries of <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\gamma^2||)</marimo-tex>.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
