            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"an-idenso-identity-before-component-evaluation\">An Idenso identity, before component evaluation</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">A single gamma matrix needs no Dirac simplification. To show a useful\nsymbolic rewrite, close a two-gamma chain instead:\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\mathrm{tr}(\\gamma^\\mu\\gamma^\\nu)=4g^{\\mu\\nu}||)</marimo-tex>.\n<code>AUTO</code> supplies the spinor endpoints that <code>trace</code> closes.</span></span>"
          }
